@EmpresaApiVB_HostAddress = http://localhost:5180

### Obtener todos
GET {{EmpresaApiVB_HostAddress}}/api/clientes
Accept: application/json

### Obtener por ID
GET {{EmpresaApiVB_HostAddress}}/api/clientes/1
Accept: application/json

### Crear
POST {{EmpresaApiVB_HostAddress}}/api/clientes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Carlos",
  "apellido": "Benitez",
  "email": "carlos.benitez@email.com",
  "telefono": "0983123456"
}

### Modificar
PUT {{EmpresaApiVB_HostAddress}}/api/clientes/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Juan Carlos",
  "apellido": "Perez",
  "email": "juan.carlos@email.com",
  "telefono": "0981999999"
}

### Eliminar
DELETE {{EmpresaApiVB_HostAddress}}/api/clientes/1
